{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "d4d22a58520018950dcf6284eae66ac0f1ee2e874f75200f9ea4f49e7c172232", "ja": "結婚情報誌のCM　撮影前", "zh": "结婚情报志广告　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4000_place", "source_sha256": "8f05b93b538d1d13f58cd027a64b63d8c0d1b46ba369efb750d464d245c52ed4", "ja": "カフェ", "zh": "咖啡厅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4001_p", "source_sha256": "a8a72fd4df1d097b6ed7bc764b4f0ce6888fe17143b9c01d829bf504d709bf88", "ja": "今日は、結婚情報誌のCM撮影ですね。\nまさにあずささんにぴったりのお仕事です。", "zh": "今天要拍摄结婚情报志的广告。\n这简直就是为梓小姐量身打造的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4002_010azu", "source_sha256": "88a1d6b1001b58ee0fee86b01f352378d86019a7a0e11080e6b7f28d3190ad16", "ja": "でも、いいんでしょうか。一応まだ独身ですから、\n結婚のことは、よくわからないんですけど……。", "zh": "不过，真的好吗？我再怎么说也还单身，\n所以对婚姻还不太了解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4003_p", "source_sha256": "f5ca825c842f75f6d20ab43d08f8284f7c8e9b9491619faddc30d3ac7cd65f4c", "ja": "あはは、そうですね。俺だって同じです。\nいつかは……って考えてみることはありますけど。", "zh": "啊哈哈，说得也是。但我也一样啊。\n虽然我有想过迟早会结婚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4004_010azu", "source_sha256": "895f5a3226bc2441ad20ba6ec79fbd70a07fafef5c555191c0492c423bc63b23", "ja": "ちなみに……。{$P$}さんの\n理想の奥さんって、どんな人なんですか？", "zh": "顺带一提……{$P$}先生的\n理想妻子，是怎么样的人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4005_p", "source_sha256": "41975d9b82c02790598a7fc8d2aad6a92c657d229cb8ea41780ab6911b9bfb75", "ja": "俺のですか？　え、ええっと、そうですね。\nまあ、しいて言うなら、ですけど……。", "zh": "我的吗？呃、呃……这个嘛。\n嗯，如果硬要说的话，就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4006", "source_sha256": "763c62bd3cfa9fb47c8adb95ba95ccf431074c5a3336baaa4c8bf149ba2fc71a", "ja": "思いやりのある人", "zh": "体贴的人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4007", "source_sha256": "5bc647416f9a1d851653e1ef0f0f46e825ccb8797ffa21812518599c4ede0e1e", "ja": "お互いに高めあえる人", "zh": "可以提升彼此的人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4008", "source_sha256": "294bdac2f3046bccf9a56f1ace1e5565f3a70d436b549e538e5da73e83e30a8e", "ja": "ナイスバディ", "zh": "身材好的人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4100_p", "source_sha256": "50a42c893d3a39308733382f4aebc6a81c155b44803098544d279edd0699e3f2", "ja": "思いやりのある、やさしい人がいいですね。\n隣にいてほっと安心できるというか……。", "zh": "体贴又温柔的人比较好吧。\n感觉待在身旁就让人放松、安心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4101_010azu", "source_sha256": "812209b9809f4238c300d8e33b0b6764efd5806e255c73bd65ca0719ba9e33e8", "ja": "うふふ、そうですね。わたしも\nやっぱりそれがいちばんだと思います～。", "zh": "唔呵呵，是这样啊。\n我也觉得那点是最重要的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4102_010azu", "source_sha256": "c60a8122001282737faf96f4f2a97e517cf33d65dcca2b2ba4bd2747b7c17138", "ja": "お互いを思いやれる人と一緒なら、きっと……\nあたたかな家庭を築くことができるって思います♪", "zh": "如果能和体贴彼此的人在一起，我想一定……\n能建立起一个温暖的家庭呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4200_p", "source_sha256": "e560007f017d32eb32bc61a4a74a24edeb706320978845424204e7c5cae9312d", "ja": "そうですね……お互いに高めあって、\n一緒に成長していける奥さんがいいですね。", "zh": "这个嘛……能够提升彼此，\n双方一起成长的妻子比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4201_010azu", "source_sha256": "d273748e00994bd1599cc94eba86b0024633f288ca6a48cd3cdba239c35a9ed8", "ja": "た、高めあう……ですか～。プロデューサーさんは\nとっても頑張り屋さんなんですね。", "zh": "提、提升彼此……吗～\n制作人先生真是勤奋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4202_010azu", "source_sha256": "4fd8871aaafc4542cf4e53603882f0936b7f3b51254156c124d220b052ca7dfe", "ja": "でも、そんなふうにふたりで上を目指せる夫婦って、\nなんだかカッコイイかもしれません～。", "zh": "不过，能像那样子两人一同以高点为目标，\n感觉似乎也很帅气呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4300_p", "source_sha256": "cc21c7619122b5cbadf9980a3c3d48014c9728b78ce8642d1d505a94ac392250", "ja": "ナイスバディがいいです。\nヘンな意味ではなく、そのままの意味で。", "zh": "身材好的人比较好。\n我没有奇怪的意思，就字面上的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4301_010azu", "source_sha256": "7ed4601658c583d0cefcfcf60c4bca9df95476aeb49e1f8884c9b72571d3ef60", "ja": "そ、そうですか。あの、{$P$}さん？\nどうして私を見つめて……？", "zh": "是、是这样啊，那个，{$P$}先生？\n请问为什么要盯着我看……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_4302_p", "source_sha256": "7f7f63d3ea7906d187c10743686b195ceedfc3c60f4b30c1c901736959435c40", "ja": "（恥ずかしそうに視線を逸らされてしまった。\nもう少しオブラートに包んだ方が良かった……かな？）", "zh": "（她难为情地撇开视线了。\n或许说得再委婉一点会比较好……吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
